# Self-contained Modelfile for the qwen36-iq3m-256k-fix derived model.
# Build:  ollama create qwen36-iq3m-256k-fix -f qwen36-iq3m-256k-fix.modelfile
#   (or ./build_qwen36_iq3m_fix.sh, which also runs a strict tools+system smoke test)
#
# WHY: the upstream chuangyeyu/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-IQ3_M:latest tag ships NO
# renderer/parser in its Ollama config, so Ollama tries to auto-generate a
# tool-call parser from the GGUF-embedded Jinja chat_template and fails —
#   400 "Unable to generate parser for this template ...
#        System message must be at the beginning."
# — on every tools+system request (i.e. every Claude Code / Codex request). The
# embedded Jinja template is byte-identical to the OFFICIAL qwen3.6 build's; the
# official works only because its config sets renderer=qwen3.5 / parser=qwen3.5,
# so Ollama uses its BUILT-IN qwen3.5 renderer + tool parser and never touches
# the Jinja template.
#
# FIX: set the same built-in renderer/parser here via the native Modelfile
# RENDERER/PARSER directives (Ollama 0.31.x supports them). REQUIRES pins the
# minimum Ollama version that ships the qwen3.5 renderer, matching the official
# build. IQ3_M weights + bundled vision projector are unchanged.
FROM chuangyeyu/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-IQ3_M:latest
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
RENDERER qwen3.5
PARSER qwen3.5
REQUIRES 0.30.0
PARAMETER num_ctx 262144
